From fd366d4c2ec53b89305db542aca48830cec477fc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Tam=C3=A1s=20Zolnai?= <zolnaitamas2000@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 12:17:53 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Adapt code to new file action API introduced in
 @nextcloud/files 4.0.0.

FileAction was removed in v4. registerFileAction() now takes a plain
object, and callbacks receive a context object instead of positional
arguments.

See also:
https://github.com/nextcloud-libraries/nextcloud-files/releases/tag/v4.0.0
---
 package-lock.json   | 906 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++----------------
 package.json        |   2 +-
 src/files-action.js |  10 +-
 3 files changed, 581 insertions(+), 337 deletions(-)

